{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cc29","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c6d9-138d-7c82-92f1-7d0657d57a0f"},"sequence":1135,"recorded_at":1780531400002265,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c6e2-183b-7941-8c4a-b2581892ad07"},"task_id":"01a0c6e2-183b-7941-8c4a-b2581892ad07","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c6e2-183b-7941-8c4a-b2581892ad07","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-26-1\",\n  \"command\": \"M=/opt/homebrew/share/man/man1/tmux.1\\nsed -n '7457,7490p' $M\\necho \\\"===DETACH===\\\"\\ngrep -n \\\"detach-client\\\" $M | head -n 5\",\n  \"description\": \"Read wait-for man section lines\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \".It Xo Ic wait-for\\n.Op Fl L | S | U\\n.Ar channel\\n.Xc\\n.D1 Pq alias: Ic wait\\nWhen used without options, prevents the client from exiting until woken using\\n.Ic wait-for\\n.Fl S\\nwith the same channel.\\nWhen\\n.Fl L\\nis used, the channel is locked and any clients that try to lock the same\\nchannel are made to wait until the channel is unlocked with\\n.Ic wait-for\\n.Fl U .\\n.El\\n.Sh EXIT MESSAGES\\nWhen a\\n.Nm\\nclient detaches, it prints a message.\\nThis may be one of:\\n.Bl -tag -width Ds\\n.It detached (from session ...)\\nThe client was detached normally.\\n.It detached and SIGHUP\\nThe client was detached and its parent sent the\\n.Dv SIGHUP\\nsignal (for example with\\n.Ic detach-client\\n.Fl P ) .\\n.It lost tty\\nThe client's\\n.Xr tty 4\\nor\\n===DETACH===\\n1098:.Ic detach-client\\n1136:.It Xo Ic detach-client\\n2682:is not given, \\\"detach-client -t \\\\[aq]%%\\\\[aq]\\\" is used.\\n7485:.Ic detach-client\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 858,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 215,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
