{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d085","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c6d9-138d-7c82-92f1-7d0657d57a0f"},"sequence":1693,"recorded_at":1780531400003381,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c6ed-c82f-7442-b936-b571fe84a51b"},"task_id":"01a0c6ed-c82f-7442-b936-b571fe84a51b","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c6ed-c82f-7442-b936-b571fe84a51b","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 139-142\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-// BoundaryChannelPrefix prefixes every wait-for channel this leaf\n-// locks on. The channel is ax-boundary-<quiescence_generation UUIDv7>:\n-// fixed prefix plus caller-bound generation, never caller free text.\n-const BoundaryChannelPrefix = \"ax-boundary-\"\n+// BoundaryChannelPrefix prefixes every wait-for channel this leaf\n+// waits on. The channel is ax-boundary-<quiescence_generation UUIDv7>:\n+// fixed prefix plus caller-bound generation, never caller free text.\n+// The observation runs the bare `wait-for <channel>` form, which\n+// blocks until the wrapper wakes it with `wait-for -S`: the `-L` form\n+// acquires a channel lock and succeeds immediately on a fresh channel\n+// without any wrapper signal, so it can never evidence a boundary.\n+const BoundaryChannelPrefix = \"ax-boundary-\"\n","final_result":true}}}
