store-branch-offer: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly parked-for-remote-interactive past the offer arm; every other branch is unchanged. Kill path: the lapsed grant parks instead of offering through the restore dispatch. [exit 1]\\nok: N-refresh-bound-default: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the 10s refresh past the measured-bound arm; configured bounds are unaffected. Kill path: the default refresh deadline and bound report read 10s through the restore dispatch. [exit 1]\\nok: N-outcome-key-record: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the empty-key empty-operation outcome past the record key arm; empty keys with an operation still refuse. Kill path: the keyless outcome records. [exit 1]\\nok: N-binddoc-session-identity: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the malformed session past the binding-doc identity arm; every other malformed identity still refuses. Kill path: the unparseable pair records a document. [exit 1]\\nok: N-binddoc-document-shape: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the broken document past the binding-doc shape arm; every other malformed document still refuses. Kill path: the non-JSON document records. [exit 1]\\nok: N-create-doc-persist: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the document-less persist for the fixture session past the binding-doc arm; every other session still keeps its document. Kill path: create succeeds but the later restore finds no document through the restore dispatch. [exit 1]\\nok: N-cmdvector-detach: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the flag-less detach vector past the fixed-shape builder; every other vector element stays exact. Kill path: the exact-vector assertions fail at the helper and through the quiesce dispatch alike. [exit 1]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2593,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 649,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
