{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e6bd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c6d9-138d-7c82-92f1-7d0657d57a0f"},"sequence":4537,"recorded_at":1780531400009069,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6"},"call_id":"call_01a0c70c034a738993ddca2a3756d3f7","text":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n(299 line(s) above)\n300|| argv (argv.go:17,24) | M TestAcquireForegroundSpawnsDedicatedServer full element compare / N-argv-detached + N-argv-tail (socket/session arms U3: socket always derived, session pre-validated; CheckArgv shape arm B12: unreachable through Acquire) | U2 background never builds spawn argv | U2 | U2 | M exact-vector + ambient-socket + invalid-shape + malformed-session tests / N-argv-socket + N-argv-tmuxenv + N-argv-shape + N-argv-session + N-argv-detached + N-argv-tail | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 |\n301|\n302|SOCK (SocketPath) is a pure join and OBS (ObserveAmbient) records\n303|without deciding: neither enforces any gate, so their columns read U\n304|throughout by construction — the wiring gate pins what callers pass\n305|to the join. CRE decides only G-creation; every other CRE cell is U\n306|because the direct entry answers only \"may this caller create\" for\n307|post-gate caller values.\n308|\n309|## Second-leaf census\n310|\n311|New columns: EXC/EXA/EXS/EXE/EXT/EXR = Execute create, attach,\n312|status, engine ops (quiesce/boundary/stop), terminate-stale, restore;\n313|PRB = ServerProber.Probe, SPW = ServerSpawner.Spawn, DIAL =\n314|UnixDialer.Dial, CMD = BuildCommand, DIRV = DirectivesFor, PDIR =\n315|ParseDirective, LEN = CheckSocketLength, CUS = CheckSocketCustody,\n316|REC/LOOK = InstanceStates Record/Lookup, CLS = ClassifyStatus, OBSP =\n317|ObserveStatus called directly, PFX = PerformEffect called directly,\n318|OSR = OSRunner called directly, UNT = unexported internals called\n319|directly in unit tests (body parsers, rowError, providerTriple,\n320|cutRow, ReconcileAdmission). Cell codes M/U1/U2/U3/B as above, with\n321|U2 reasons tagged: U2a = entry never calls this code; U2b = entry\n322|tests carry post-gate values only (the narrowed direction is measured\n323|at the listed entry); U2c = reachable only through caller-injected\n324|Production Dependencies with no committed composition test (bound\n325|B27).\n326|\n327|Table B: old gates × new entries (24 × 21 = 504 cells; 10 M, 494\n328|U2a). Only the verify side (via custody delegation) and the server\n329|attestation (via attach) are reachable from new entries; every other\n330|old gate reads U2a throughout because no new code calls it (new code\n331|never ensures, never lexically gates, never reads ambient, never\n332|remaps, never consults creation, and never calls BuildArgv,\n333|CheckBrokerContact, or the Acquire call sites).\n334|\n335|| Gate (site) | EXC | EXA | EXS | EXE | EXT | EXR | PRB | SPW | DIAL | CMD | DIRV | PDIR | LEN | CUS | REC | LOOK | CLS | OBSP | PFX | OSR | UNT |\n336||---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n337|| caller (acquire.go:149) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n338|| details (acquire.go:152) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n339|| render (acquire.go:289) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n340|| dispatch (acquire.go:163) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n341|| plat (runtime.go:76) | U2a | U