directory/no-probe assertions in `TestAcquireForegroundRefusesMalformedSession` and shipped `N-session-entry` (kills through the side-effect assertions while the refusal code stays correct).\\n- Census-driven closures beyond the verdict: caller-dimension subtests on the pre-dispatch gates (override/collision/details/unknown-platform tables drive both callers); `N-dispatch-foreground`/`N-dispatch-background` for the caller→path routing; `N-wiring-lexical/ensure/verify` for the three `RuntimeDirName` sites; `N-details-generation/brokerstate/constructor` (incl. the input-reachable invalid-UTF-8 arm, pinned with a probe-order assertion); `N-root-symlink-commit/verify` plus verify- and background-entry symlink-root tests; `N-argv-detached/tail` with a full element-by-element vector assertion through the spawn entry; background-entry symlink-leaf and handle-mismatch tests; mask extensions so shared-site rows kill through every entry they cover (attribution verified per entry from the raw logs).\\n- Observations: row 23/B16 scope comma roots out of the TMUX member's encoding and symlinked-or-relative aliases out of the cleaned-string gate; B9 states `Dependencies.Spawn` as inert on the background path; B15 names the commit-side leaf-`Stat` and `NewGuard` arms; static-gate exit codes recorded in the evidence archive.\\n- Battery: 72 narrowing + 2 additive KILLED + control SURVIVED, 75/75 twice with identical verdicts and per-plant raw logs. AC: 58 of 58 rows driven through production entries by named tests (matrix rev6). Full 30-command suite green firsthand (race gate in 6 bounded groups with identical flags, 45/45, no DATA RACE); `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet` exit 0; tmux-hidden suite 0 skip. Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree.\\n\\n### TASK-260830-35urbp rev5 — Private tmux server management rework (custody oracle, Request.Name removal, platform-axis absence pin, spy census)\\n\\n- REWORKED after review-verdict-rev4 (CHANGES REQUESTED: no P1, two P2, two P3