e request ID\\n446-// alone; create and restore take session_id + bootstrap_operation_id;\\n447-// attach takes terminal_instance_id + client_id; quiesce-input takes\\n448-// terminal_instance_id + \\\"quiesce\\\" + quiescence_generation;\\n449-// wait-safe-boundary takes terminal_instance_id + \\\"boundary\\\" +\\n450-// quiescence_generation + provider_proof_kind; request-stop takes\\n451-// terminal_instance_id + \\\"stop\\\" + safe_boundary_evidence_id;\\n452-// terminate-stale takes terminal_instance_id + \\\"terminate\\\" +\\n453-// stale_lease_id + decimal stale_epoch; status takes its full queried\\n454-// identity tuple, of at least one segment.\\n455-func IdempotencyKey(operation string, segments ...string) (string, error) {\\n456-\\tparsedOperation, err := ParseOperation(operation)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1846,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 462,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
