new gates × new entries (90 × 21 = 1890 cells; 108 M, 30\\nB, 1752 U; counts verified by script over the table). Test names\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nnew = \\\"\\\"\\\"Table D: new gates × new entries (115 × 21 = 2415 cells; 148 M, 30\\nB, 2237 U; counts verified by script over the table). Test names\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nassert text.count(old) == 1\\ntext = text.replace(old, new)\\n\\n# Ratio paragraph.\\nold = \\\"\\\"\\\"Ratio: 168 measured of 3648 (50+10+108 M across Tables A/B/D;\\nTable C all U); 34 bound; 3446 unreachable with reasons. Every\\ndriven refusal direction is measured except the bound cells: 22\\ndriven but rowless (B22 singletons/forks, B23 normalized details,\\nB29 poll past-deadline, B30 mappings, B32 propagation) and 8 named\\nundriven gaps (B24/B25/B26/B28/B31 cells, B29 dispatch side), each\\nwith its owner below.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nnew = \\\"\\\"\\\"Ratio: 208 measured of 4448 (50+10+148 M across Tables A/B/D;\\nTable C all U); 34 bound; 4206 unreachable with reasons. Every\\ndriven refusal direction is measured except the bound cells: 22\\ndriven but rowless (B22 singletons/forks, B23 normalized details,\\nB29 poll past-deadline, B32 propagation) and 8 named undriven gaps\\n(B24/B25/B26/B28/B31 cells, B29 dispatch side), each with its owner\\nbelow.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nassert text.count(old) == 1\\ntext = text.replace(old, new)\\n\\np.write_text(text)\\nprint(\\\"paragraphs updated\\\")\\nPYEOF\",\n  \"description\": \"Update census paragraphs\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"paragraphs updated\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 19,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 5,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
