 verify side (via custody delegation) and the server\n168|attestation (via attach) are reachable from new entries; every other\n169|old gate reads U2a throughout because no new code calls it (new code\n170|never ensures, never lexically gates, never reads ambient, never\n171|remaps, never consults creation, and never calls BuildArgv,\n172|CheckBrokerContact, or the Acquire call sites).\n173|\n174|| Gate (site) | EXC | EXA | EXS | EXE | EXT | EXR | PRB | SPW | DIAL | CMD | DIRV | PDIR | LEN | CUS | REC | LOOK | CLS | OBSP | PFX | OSR | UNT |\n175||---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n176|| caller (acquire.go:149) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n177|| details (acquire.go:152) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n178|| render (acquire.go:289) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n179|| dispatch (acquire.go:163) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
