e helper by bound B23.\n422|\n423|## Crash, idempotency, and determinism\n424|\n425|Every mutating operation replays the identical request without\n426|new execs (seven idempotency tests, one per mutating op);\n427|uncertain receipts reconcile through status before resuming\n428|(resume tests for effect failure, recheck failure, and\n429|otherwise-proven status); tampered and corrupt replays refuse\n430|(per-member tamper table, corrupt-image, hook-failure tests).\n431|No committed test execs a real tmux, dials a real socket, or\n432|reads wall time: the scripted runner, staged sockets, and\n433|manual clock are the only tmux the suite sees, and the suite\n434|passes with no tmux installed (bound B1).\n435|\n436|## Validation and evidence\n437|\n438|Full 30-command configured suite green firsthand on the frozen\n439|tree (gofmt, build, vet, full suite, race gate, cover, all fuzz\n440|gates, tracecheck, cataloggen, linux/windows builds, JSON\n441|check, board validate, diff check, windows vet); the\n442|OUTCOME-keyed base-vs-candidate importer comparison is clean\n443|(base 82 PASS retained, new tests added, zero regressions).\n444|Raw logs: `TASK-260830-1c28dz_producer-evidence.tar.gz`.","final_result":true}}}
