ls here | U2a Complete runs post-Bind once | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 |\n309|| pollbound (backend.go:300) | U1 | U1 | U1 | B29 lesser-fed; boundary unmeasured | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | U1 | B29 past-deadline pinned; boundary unmeasured | U1 | U1 |\n310|\n311|Symmetry (two-sided gates; each side ships its own mutant and its\n312|own killer, verified built): scrub TMUX/TMPDIR; cmdvector detached\n313|(CMD+EXC+EXR) / attach-flagless (CMD+EXA); winner lease/epoch\n314|(winner session arm U3: fencing+target precede); target\n315|session/lease/epoch; capdual stale/provider; attachcap local/mesh;\n316|agreement session/instance/backend/generation; authkind entry/loop ×\n317|terminate/restore; generation entry/loop; deadline entry/loop ×\n318|terminate/restore + attach; keymaterial terminate/restore; record\n319|success/failure; resume state arm (error arm subsumed for engine\n320|reports: errors always carry the zero report); replay\n321|session/corrupt (+6 pinned members); fencingmap force/invalid (+3\n322|pinned members); dialstale refused/missing; probedeps\n323|dialer/admission; bind wiring placement/verify; sunpath helper/EXE\n324|8-op/prober; placement gate/prober; leafwiring 2 sites; presentmemory\n325|helper/dispatch/observer; triple helper/dispatch; boundarywait\n326|helper/dispatch; waitlesser/stoplesser min/fallback; bindmap\n327|coded/uncoded; evidence digest/forged.\n328|\n329|Ratio: 168 measured of 3648 (50+10+108 M across Tables A/B/D;\n330|Table C all U); 34 bound; 3446 unreachable with reasons. Every\n331|driven refusal direction is measured except the bound cells: 22\n332|driven but rowless (B22 singletons/forks, B23 normalized details,\n333|B29 poll past-deadline, B30 mappings, B32 propagation) and 8 named\n334|undriven gaps (B24/B25/B26/B28/B31 cells, B29 dispatch side), each\n335|with its owner below.\n336|\n337|\n338|## Bounds (mirrored B22-B32 plus carried dispositions)\n339|\n340|- B22 Singleton arms ship no narrowing mutant: admitting the\n341|  singleton refused member is deleting the gate. Covered sites, each\n342|  test-pinned in both directions where a fork exists: create relay\n343|  transport (relay), descriptor presence fork (descpresence),\n344|  attach admission nil (serveadmitnil), spawner runner nil\n345|  (spawnnil), reconcile verifier nil (reconcilenil), states root\n346|  empty (stateopen), persist/attach stores nil (storenil),\n347|  failed-kill self-confirm (selfconfirm), live-after-escalation\n348|  (stoptimeout). Owner: this leaf; retest if any site grows a\n349|  second refused member.\n350|- B23 The landed status engine normalizes backend error details to\n351|  \"status observation unknown\" (coded or not), so the cutrow and\n352|  empty-panes narrowings measure at the helper entries while the\n353|  dispatch legs pin the code. Owner: this leaf; retest if the\n354|  engine stops normalizing.\n355|- B24 The idempotency-store Completed read-failure arm is unstaged:\n356|  no seam fails receipt reads (hooks fire on write paths only).\n357|  Owner: hardening; stage with a read-failure seam to measure.\n358|- B25 The Bind clean-miss sub-arm is unstageable: every Bind error\n359|  the hooks stage leaves the committed file, so Lookup always finds\n360|  it. The clean-found sub-arm is measured (N-bind-hook-found).\n361|  Owner: hardening.\n362|- B26 The attach effect-failure dispatch mapping is unstaged: no\n363|  committed failure reaches it (the store replays identical\n364|  receipts; conflicting receipts are untested at dispatch).\n365|  Owner: hardening.\n366|- B27 No committed test composes the Production Dependencies into\n367|  Acquire: AFG reaches the adapter and bind gates only through\n368|  caller-injected implementations (the 19 Table C U2c cells). The\n369|  injection seam is first-leaf-owned; Production wiring is\n370|  unit-pinned (TestProductionWiresDependencies). Owner: composition\n371|  test, sibling scope.\n372|- B28 The backend command-error wrap is unmeasured at PFX (no\n373|  backend test stages a refused build; the builder rows pin the\n374|  refused shapes at CMD). Owner: this leaf; retest with a\n375|  refused-build backend test.\n376|- B29 The close-confirm poll deadline is pinned for past-deadline\n377|  at PFX via direct staging; the exact-boundary member and\n378|  dispatch-level staging are unmeasured (the fake runner advances\n379|  no time). Owner: hardening.\n380|- B30 The OSRunner exit/transport/argv mappings are total functions\n381|  over uncoded inputs with no refused class to admit a member of;\n382|  four tests pin them including a real-exec scrub integration.\n383|  Owner: this leaf.\n384|- B31 The custody root-ownership arm is untested and singleton: the\n385|  ownership seam stages leaf-first (the leaf refuses before the\n386|  root arm runs), and a truly foreign root needs privilege. Owner:\n387|  hardening with a privileged stage or a root-level seam.\n388|- B32 The leaf-delegation wiring is measured at CUS (wrong-leaf\n389|  mutants are observable only on compliant roots); the absence\n390|  propagation through the six dispatch paths, the prober, and the\n391|  spawner is pinned by absence tests without a row. Owner: this\n392|  leaf.\n393|\n394|Carried bounds (first-leaf statements dispositioned by this leaf).\n395|B9 adapter split is discharged: the production exec, dial, probe,\n396|and spawn adapters ship (exec.go, probe.go, backend.go) and\n397|Production wires them into Dependencies; the residual is the\n398|uncomposed wiring (B27). B16 nested invocation is decided: lifecycle\n399|entries take no Ambient input, so nesting cannot collide through\n400|them (row 90); the Acquire-level over-strict nested refusal stands\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
