{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000fff1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c6d9-138d-7c82-92f1-7d0657d57a0f"},"sequence":7763,"recorded_at":1780531400015521,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c748-6359-79c1-9027-3f72c00015ae"},"task_id":"01a0c748-6359-79c1-9027-3f72c00015ae","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c748-6359-79c1-9027-3f72c00015ae","chunk":"Read text file `/tmp/c28dz/matrix-new.md`.\n(480 line(s) above)\n481|## Mutant battery\n482|\n483|`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3\n484|internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py`: 134 second-leaf\n485|narrowing rows KILLED, 1 harmless control SURVIVED (shared with\n486|the first leaf's 76 rows, all still green), full pass with one\n487|raw log per plant in the evidence tarball. Multi-entry rows\n488|list every entry their killers cover, attribution verified per\n489|test from the raw logs (see the row notes). Singleton refusal\n490|arms ship no row by bound B22; engine-normalized status details\n491|measure at the helper by bound B23.\n492|\n493|## Crash, idempotency, and determinism\n494|\n495|Every mutating operation replays the identical request without\n496|new execs (seven idempotency tests, one per mutating op);\n497|uncertain receipts reconcile through status before resuming\n498|(resume tests for effect failure, recheck failure, and\n499|otherwise-proven status); tampered and corrupt replays refuse\n500|(per-member tamper table, corrupt-image, hook-failure tests).\n501|No committed test execs a real tmux, dials a real socket, or\n502|reads wall time: the scripted runner, staged sockets, and\n503|manual clock are the only tmux the suite sees, and the suite\n504|passes with no tmux installed (bound B1).\n505|\n506|## Validation and evidence\n507|\n508|Full 30-command configured suite green firsthand on the frozen\n509|tree (gofmt, build, vet, full suite, race gate, cover, all fuzz\n510|gates, tracecheck, cataloggen, linux/windows builds, JSON\n511|check, board validate, diff check, windows vet); the\n512|OUTCOME-keyed base-vs-candidate importer comparison over the\n513|complete 34-package importer closure is clean (2662 shared top-level\n514|inputs and 20345 shared subtests, zero moved; 205 top-level and 169\n515|subtest additions, all PASS; zero removed).\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
