{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000101a5","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c6d9-138d-7c82-92f1-7d0657d57a0f"},"sequence":7981,"recorded_at":1780531400015957,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"69dcebcf-aab8-4829-be62-f7110c555cc6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c749-7453-7940-9e14-8f8622595237"},"task_id":"01a0c749-7453-7940-9e14-8f8622595237","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c749-7453-7940-9e14-8f8622595237","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-191-1\",\n  \"command\": \"tail -n 25 /tmp/c28dz/matrix-new.md; echo =====; ls -la /tmp/c28dz/importer* /tmp/c28dz/outcome* /tmp/c28dz/*closure* /tmp/c28dz/*compare* 2>/dev/null; echo =====; diff /tmp/c28dz/matrix.md /tmp/c28dz/matrix-new.md | head -n 10\",\n  \"description\": \"Check matrix tail and importer files\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"\\n## Crash, idempotency, and determinism\\n\\nEvery mutating operation replays the identical request without\\nnew execs (seven idempotency tests, one per mutating op);\\nuncertain receipts reconcile through status before resuming\\n(resume tests for effect failure, recheck failure, and\\notherwise-proven status); tampered and corrupt replays refuse\\n(per-member tamper table, corrupt-image, hook-failure tests).\\nNo committed test execs a real tmux, dials a real socket, or\\nreads wall time: the scripted runner, staged sockets, and\\nmanual clock are the only tmux the suite sees, and the suite\\npasses with no tmux installed (bound B1).\\n\\n## Validation and evidence\\n\\nFull 30-command configured suite green firsthand on the frozen\\ntree (gofmt, build, vet, full suite, race gate, cover, all fuzz\\ngates, tracecheck, cataloggen, linux/windows builds, JSON\\ncheck, board validate, diff check, windows vet); the\\nOUTCOME-keyed base-vs-candidate importer comparison over the\\ncomplete 34-package importer closure is clean (2662 shared top-level\\ninputs and 20345 shared subtests, zero moved; 205 top-level and 169\\nsubtest additions, all PASS; zero removed).\\nRaw logs: `TASK-260830-1c28dz_rework-evidence-rev2.tar.gz`.=====\\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 iv  wheel     10494 Sep 22 07:22 /tmp/c28dz/importer-added.txt\\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 iv  wheel  31547633 Sep 22 07:22 /tmp/c28dz/importer-base.json\\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 iv  wheel   5721982 Sep 22 07:01 /tmp/c28dz/importer-base.log\\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 iv  wheel  31882482 Sep 22 07:20 /tmp/c28dz/importer-cand.json\\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 iv  wheel   5763098 Sep 22 07:17 /tmp/c28dz/importer-cand.log\\n=====\\n6,7c6,7\\n< carried), 100 narrowing mutants KILLED plus the shared harmless\\n< control SURVIVED, gate × entry census 168 measured of 3648 with\\n---\\n> carried), 134 narrowing mutants KILLED plus the shared harmless\\n> control SURVIVED, gate × entry census 208 measured of 4448 with\\n30,32c30,32\\n< | 59 | The exec adapter runs -S vectors with AX-owned argv only: exits report as data, TMUX/TMUX_TMPDIR scrub from the child, malformed argv refuses, transport failures pass through uncoded and prove nothing. | OSRunner (exec.go) | TestOSRunnerReportsExitAsData, TestOSRunnerScrubsAmbientInChild, TestOSRunnerRefusesBadArgv, TestOSRunnerTransportErrorProvesNothing, TestScrubTmuxEnv |\\n< | 60 | The primitive vocabulary is exactly the nine tmux directives and the per-operation map covers exactly the eight lifecycle operations; unknown primitives and non-lifecycle operations refuse. | ParseDirective, DirectivesFor | TestParseDirectiveAdmitsNinePrimitives, TestParseDirectiveRefusesUnknown, TestDirectivesForMapsEightOperations, TestDirectivesForRefusesNonLifecycle |\\n< | 61 | Every built vector is the fixed -S shape for its directive: the socket is pinned to the runtime leaf (ambient sockets refuse), targets parse as UUIDv7, and the quiescence channel parses as UUIDv7. | BuildCommand | TestBuildCommandVectors, TestBuildCommandRefusesAmbientSocket, TestBuildCommandRefusesBadIdentity |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2970,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 743,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
